{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981560/extras/e487a9011e72ce40fac698ca950f54c2.avif?t=1771853115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981560/extras_big/e487a9011e72ce40fac698ca950f54c2.webp?t=1771853115 width=1560 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An \u201caccident\u201d causes you, a third-year college student, to lose part of your memory\u2014including the English vocabulary you once mastered. Urgently needing to rebuild your word power to meet the demands of your future career, you join an experimental program called the <strong>\u201cTen-Thousand Words Club.\u201d</strong> There, you encounter four beautiful girls whose fates become intertwined with your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin by choosing a vocabulary book and setting up your own study plan, including your learning methods and the number of new and review words per day. By completing these study tasks, you earn virtual currency, increase your assistants\u2019 affection levels, and unlock new story content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*After finishing your daily study plan, you may continue learning and reviewing through additional features, or choose to work part-time or fight monsters in the virtual world to earn extra currency and experience. Whether \u201cworking\u201d or \u201cmonster hunting,\u201d both are vocabulary-based games designed for review. While playing, you strengthen your mastery of previously learned words. With the virtual currency you earn, you can purchase outfits, stockings, combat equipment, houses, and gifts for your assistants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The story evolves based on your choices and the affection levels of the assistants. If you wish to pursue your favorite assistant, select her more often as your active assistant, complete your self-designed study plans, and earn plenty of virtual currency to give her gifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The game\u2019s main antagonist has also set his sights on the four beautiful assistants and sees you as a rival, causing trouble throughout the story. But don\u2019t worry\u2014if your vocabulary skills are strong enough, the assistants will always stand by your side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981560/extras/4f03fef86aadff9e8c20cf314f50ab65.avif?t=1771853115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981560/extras_big/4f03fef86aadff9e8c20cf314f50ab65.webp?t=1771853115 width=1560 height=466 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*High Efficiency: Learning efficiency is the top priority. Gameplay never compromises the effectiveness of vocabulary learning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Multiple Motivation Systems: Virtual assistant companionship, word-based \u201cgirlfriend\u201d development, multiple story endings, rewards from vocabulary mini-games, and a rich achievement system\u2014all designed to continuously motivate you and keep your vocabulary study engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*A More Scientific, User-Focused, and Personalized Learning Experience: We understand the flaws of traditional memorization methods. By making vocabulary learning more dynamic and moderately stimulating, we reduce boredom and drowsiness. We value user experience and never blindly recommend review workloads beyond your capacity. With multiple learning modes available, anything that can be customized is left in your hands and can be adjusted at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*High-Quality Production: Full professional voice acting throughout the game, over 70 beautifully hand-drawn story CGs (including animated CGs), and several well-produced original theme and ending songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Deep Immersion: You play as a character living in a virtual town, seamlessly blending learning with exploration. The town features day, dusk, and night cycles, allowing you to freely explore, fight monsters, trade, and engage in vocabulary battles\u2014putting an end to dull memorization once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981560/extras/f68820d5b8231dda9d792df8d48b6696.avif?t=1771853115\" width=1560 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1981560?t=1771853115","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771853115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981560/96aa5c4984787e29e17768f2bda3173a19d6e97e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771853115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981560/96aa5c4984787e29e17768f2bda3173a19d6e97e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771853115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mild to moderate mature content, including suggestive dialogue, romantic and intimate interactions, and characters depicted in revealing or sexually suggestive outfits.\r\n\r\nThe game may include visual emphasis on body contours or visible cleavage, as well as non-explicit intimate elements such as massage scenes and foot-focused depictions.\r\n\r\nThe game does not contain explicit sexual acts, visible genitalia, sexual violence, non-consensual content, or any depiction involving minors.\r